WEBVTT

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.060
What a beautiful weather...

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:10.820
I wish it could be like this every day...

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.230
It'll be summer before you even know it, though.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:16.740
I like when it's hot out, too.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.790
Are those two still at it?

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:20.660
Yup.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.090
Here comes the pitch, Keiiehi!

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.090
This is the end for you!

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.950
Don't be silly!

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.150
It was my intention not to hit it,

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:04.510
aiming for a walk-off home run.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:05.470
You liar.

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:09.350
The Häagen-Dash is going
to Team Matsunaga!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:10.690
Say what?!

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.860
You mean, Team Katakura!

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:16.850
Yeah!

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:17.980
Nice one, Keiichi!

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:20.110
Nice Häagen!

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:23.530
Na-chan, you owe me a Häagen-Dash.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:27.720
Mattsun was bragging
like he had it in the bag!

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:31.210
Kei-chan's athletic prowess
are not to be underestimated.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:37.720
Nothing beats victory ice cream
eaten down by the river bed!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.380
I agree.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.680
This is your fault, Mattsun.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.020
How?!

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.510
Keiichi had Taizou on his team, too!

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:49.560
Still, Kei-chain's well-rounded
when it comes to sports.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.070
I like to try a bit of everything, you know.

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.610
If there were an Anything and
Everything Team, I'd join it.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:58.030
Then, do you want to join them next?

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.540
The Basketball Team Army.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.990
Whoa, they're playing again?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.410
They're pretty tough, doing this
even when they don't have practice.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:08.220
Why are they so full of energy?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.340
Because they're an athletics club, probably.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:13.830
Come to think of it,
we're not part of any clubs.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:14.810
There!

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.520
I bet Natsuki wants to play now, too.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.340
Huh?

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.770
Why?

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.460
This guy was on the tennis team
in middle school.

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:26.260
Oh! Then, you should go join in!

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.160
But I was never all that good.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.140
And then came that trauma...

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.540
Trauma?

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:36.940
Huh? What's up?

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.530
You're done already?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:42.820
Oh, no, some college students
took the court from us.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.360
You're too close, idiot!

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:45.490
Hilarious!

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.160
Hey, you're right!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.130
They took our rackets, too.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.600
It's a real pain,
having to wait for them to finish.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.420
How could they? That's just mean!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.340
I know, right?

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.280
Hey, kid!

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.990
Fetch that ball for me.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.760
Ah, okay.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.930
I feel like I've seen him before...

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.810
That brown-haired squirt
sitting on the steps.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.640
Ah! Hashiba! It's you, right?

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:17.860
Imagawa-senpai, it's been a while.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:22.120
Well, well, if it isn't Hashiba!
This takes me back!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.150
I didn't recognize you with your hair dyed.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.100
You know him?

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.610
We borrowed those rackets
from the tennis team,

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.500
so could you ask him to give them back?

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.530
Um, lmagawa-senpai!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.280
Those rackets belong to the tennis team.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.710
Could I ask you to return them?

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:45.470
Huh? Rackets?

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:48.720
Yes! They're borrowed, so...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.440
Oh, these, huh?

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.180
Fine.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.550
If you defeat us, we'll give them back.

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:56.100
Huh?

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.410
I'm saying that we'll give them back,

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:01.850
if you and your three friends there
can defeat the four of us in a match.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:06.150
Uh, we can't play tennis, so...

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.600
So what?

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.960
You got a problem with it?

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:13.330
Oh yeah, and the losers
become the winners' slaves.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.780
Go on, you choose the order.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:19.920
We'll keep it simple, the first to win
two doubles matches is victorious.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.400
Oh, right.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.590
We're all former tennis team members,
just so you know.

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:28.820
How immature!

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.430
That's not fair.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.710
I'm sorry about this.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:34.700
It's not your fault!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.850
Was he your senior?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:40.540
Yeah, he was a senior on my
middle school tennis team.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.440
Hashiba!

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.110
Yes?

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.920
Have you gotten a little
more used to playing now?

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.490
Yeah! Practicing against the wall is fun!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.520
Good.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.080
Oh, Na-chan!

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.660
Yoohoo!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.160
Giving it your best?

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:57.570
Aya-san.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:02.090
And lmagawa, don't bully Na-chan.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.550
O-Okay.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.590
I'm a good senior to you, right?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:06.190
Yeah!

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:07.220
Aya!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.780
Oh, coming!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.500
Hashiba, do you know Ohno?

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:15.220
My sister was Aya-san's senior.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.610
That's why I joined the tennis team, too.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.360
S-So that's why!

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.570
Let's be buds!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:22.440
Sure!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:27.090
After that, he took even better care of me
and helped me enjoy being on the team...

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.930
...until that autumn...

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.350
I'm late!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.280
I...!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.780
I love you!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:33.730
But...

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:34.750
It's true!

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.120
Totally head over heels!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.290
So, go out with me!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.290
I'll treat you right.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:43.710
Oh, Na-chan, great timing.

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:49.270
Imagawa, if you ever had a face as cute
as Na-chan's, then I'd consider it!

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:51.680
Yours is kind of scruffy,
with chiseled features.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.350
Shock!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:54.730
Later!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.920
Hey, Hashiba-kun.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.310
Yes?

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.920
About the team...

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.520
Don't you dare quit.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:11.010
After that day, he suddenly transformed
into a super spiteful teacher from Sparta.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:14.150
And my once-fun team
became a living hell!

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:18.300
Wait, he was just taking it out on you.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.960
But I can see how that
might be traumatizing...

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.690
My tears well up just remembering it...

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.750
Hurry it up, will ya?

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.010
We're being called.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:27.880
Okay!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.500
Let's give it a go.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.730
Once for Natsuki and once for the rackets!

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:33.300
Let's clobber them!

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.050
Guys...

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.200
'Kay, I call umpire, then.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.520
You're playing, too!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.460
What? Seriously?

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.790
I'll play.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.020
I was the one who borrowed
the rackets, after all.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.900
That frail guy's gonna play!

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.490
I won't let this get to Natsuki.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.310
We'll win two in a row.

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:56.370
I Just have to go with the flow, huh?

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.820
Five game match.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:07:59.570
Play!

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:04.870
Game set, won by College Team.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:06.210
Yeah!

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.120
They lost, after all.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.590
They got utterly wrecked.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.870
Tsuyoshi! You have to cover more ground!

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:14.210
I can't...

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.550
I'm the indoorsy type...

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.230
Tsuyopon!

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.860
Tsuyoshi collapsed!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:22.980
Come on, I won't get to do anything.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:26.940
Kei-chan!

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.730
Let's win this together!

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:31.740
Sure.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:35.160
Na-chan... Take my racket...

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:38.090
Sorry I couldn't win...

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:40.390
Avenge... me...

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.250
Tsuyoshi!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.960
Tsuyoshi, hang in there!

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:48.880
Play!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.660
Whoa, Natsuki's amazing.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.650
Huh, he's actually good.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:59.350
Fifteen-Love!

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.680
Na-chan, good luck.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.270
Do not lose!

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.320
Thirty-Love!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.600
Na-chan!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.480
Let's give it our best!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.900
Leave the back court to me.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:11.880
—Good luck!
—Win!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.820
—Feel free to use your special attacks.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:14.690
Yeah!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.290
Game set.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.760
All right!

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.690
Damn these brats!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.800
Hey! They won one!

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.330
Natsuki's awesome.

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.260
He's good.

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:27.500
And it's amazing...

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.130
...how happy he looks.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:35.680
Usually he's either crying, troubled,
or got a weird look on his face.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.440
He'd be more popular with girls,
if he looked like this all the time,

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.720
Whoa! That'd be boring for us!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:41.550
Well, yeah.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:43.260
Game, set, match!

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:45.930
Won by High School Team.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.200
You two were amazing!

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.910
Hey, good game.

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:54.820
Wow, Natsuki was good and all,
but you were impressive as well, Keiichi!

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.050
You can do anything, really.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:58.030
Are you a genius?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.350
For an idiot.

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:02.370
Here.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.200
You can have these back.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.290
Oh, right.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:09.710
You've... matured.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:11.960
Senpai...

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.090
So long, and take care.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.360
Hold it,

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.800
Na-chan's senpai.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:21.240
What makes you think you can leave
on a good note like that?

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.540
Remember?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.420
You're our slaves.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:26.470
Sadistic Keiichi-kun...

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:34.110
I think my swing's gotten sharper
after playing all that tennis.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.280
Huh! Wai—

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.770
Hold on!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.440
Well, thanks, guys.

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:44.950
See you tomorrow.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:58.160
Na-chan, you were great,
and you seemed to enjoy it.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.280
Yeah, it was fun.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:02.130
Why not join the team again?

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.810
If there's a match,
we'll come cheer you on.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.530
I think it was fun...

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:10.600
because it was us playing together!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.490
There you go, talking like that again.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:14.770
I don't know.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.330
We laze around most of the time, anyway.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.120
We never work up a sweat.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.130
We don't study, either.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.530
Aren't we worthless?

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:23.970
Yup!

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.450
It's fun that way!
